    "description": "• Experience in Sanity testing, Functional testing, GUI testing, Regression testing and Feature testing on Samsung devices and subsequent adding or clearing of issue logs in PLM\n• Executed different types of OTA SW update test plans, OTADM IOT Diagnostic, MMS, and Android Platform test plan on Verizon network. Performed testing on the various upcoming Samsung mobile device including Tablets and Wearables.  \n• Effectively communicated with developers in South Korea for quick and better analysis of issues found\n• Experienced in Samsung mobile flashing with ODIN tools. Utilized Qualcomm tools such as QXDM and QCAT used for logging\n• Extensively used ADB commands for android testing\n• Tested the devices under different networks and Internet speeds including on 3G, 4G/LTE and Wi-Fi. Performed testing on VoLTE and VoWIFI calls.",
